68
00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:04.230 line:0% position:50% align:center
For example, on an approved Vande Bharat tour, a Level 7
employee checks

69
00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:08.410 line:0% position:50% align:center
Shatabdi Chair Car; for Humsafar, check the Rajdhani class.

70
00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.350 line:0% position:50% align:center
A train's name is not an automatic pass to Executive class.

71
00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:16.400 line:0% position:50% align:center
Where two places are not connected by rail, employees entitled
to AC Second

72
00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:20.540 line:0% position:50% align:center
