74
00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:26.440 line:0% position:50% align:center
For example, a Level 7 employee must visit a place with no
rail connection;

75
00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:29.760 line:0% position:50% align:center
subject to the other conditions, they may check AC bus
entitlement.

76
00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.600 line:0% position:50% align:center
This is not the complete taxi or road-mileage table.

77
00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:37.030 line:0% position:50% align:center
If both places are connected by rail, public road transport is
allowed,

78
00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:40.410 line:0% position:50% align:center
