79
00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:44.190 line:0% position:50% align:center
For example, if the bus fare is Rs 900 and the entitled train
fare is Rs 1,000,

80
00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:48.190 line:0% position:50% align:center
that fare condition is met; the other checks still apply.

81
00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:51.910 line:0% position:50% align:center
Suppose a Level 7 AC Second seat is unavailable: under this
rule,

82
00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:55.470 line:0% position:50% align:center
a lower class may be used; there is no automatic higher-class
upgrade.

83
00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.980 line:0% position:50% align:center
For Government-account air tickets on official tours, the 2022

84
00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:05.000 line:0% position:50% align:center
order names three authorised agents: Balmer Lawrie, Ashok
Travels and

85
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.820 line:0% position:50% align:center
Tours, and IRCTC.

86
00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:11.700 line:0% position:50% align:center
Check the Best Available Fare in the entitled class in the
fixed three-hour slot;

87
00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:16.480 line:0% position:50% align:center
also see the stated 10% convenience band. Example: a 10 am

88
00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.730 line:0% position:50% align:center
