relaxation.

91
00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.160 line:0% position:50% align:center
Booking 21 days ahead is encouraged, but do not treat it as a
mandatory

92
00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:36.700 line:0% position:50% align:center
