94
00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:43.910 line:0% position:50% align:center
Example: an urgent tour is booked two days ahead, so keep the
reason ready.

95
00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:47.430 line:0% position:50% align:center
Within 72 hours after the journey is completed, the prescribed
completion

96
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:50.330 line:0% position:50% align:center
