97
00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:54.540 line:0% position:50% align:center
Mileage points should not be generated for Government-account
air travel.

98
00:05:54.800 --> 00:06:00.520 line:0% position:50% align:center
Now let's understand Daily Allowance on official tour. There
are three components:

99
00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:04.900 line:0% position:50% align:center
eligible hotel stay, travel within the city and a food lump
sum.

100
00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:10.290 line:0% position:50% align:center
Example: an employee's train ticket is journey fare. Hotel,
local travel

101
00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.000 line:0% position:50% align:center
and food are checked under separate rules.

102
00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.850 line:0% position:50% align:center
Here, do not confuse Daily Allowance with salary-related
Dearness

103
00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.830 line:0% position:50% align:center
Allowance.

104
00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:22.860 line:0% position:50% align:center
In the 2017 order, the listed hotel, food and some travel
ceilings

105
00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:25.400 line:0% position:50% align:center
rise when Dearness Allowance increases by 50%:

106
00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.200 line:0% position:50% align:center
the specified increase is 25%.

107
00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:32.570 line:0% position:50% align:center
Dearness Allowance reached 50% in January 2024. Example:

108
00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:36.570 line:0% position:50% align:center
Level 7's food base was Rs 800; after the first increase it
becomes

109
00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:37.900 line:0% position:50% align:center
