110
00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:42.430 line:0% position:50% align:center
Do not add another 25% merely because Dearness Allowance moves
from 50% to 60%.

111
00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.510 line:0% position:50% align:center
Check the journey date and latest order.

112
00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:50.600 line:0% position:50% align:center
After the first increase, the general hotel ceilings per day
are: Level 14 and

113
00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:54.640 line:0% position:50% align:center
above Rs 9,375; Level 12 to

114
00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.590 line:0% position:50% align:center
13A Rs 5,625.

115
00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:02.400 line:0% position:50% align:center
Level 9 to 11: Rs 2,812.50;

116
00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.720 line:0% position:50% align:center
Level 6 to 8: Rs 937.50; Level 5

117
00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:09.590 line:0% position:50% align:center
and below: Rs 562.50.

118
00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:14.580 line:0% position:50% align:center
Example: a Level 9 eligible room charge is Rs 2,000; a higher

119
00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.540 line:0% position:50% align:center
