125
00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:39.140 line:0% position:50% align:center
The special ceiling requires the relevant voucher.

126
00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:44.050 line:0% position:50% align:center
Example: an eligible Level 7 Class X stay with a voucher is
