131
00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:04.830 line:0% position:50% align:center
After the first increase, the full-day reference amounts are:
Level 14 and above

132
00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:09.630 line:0% position:50% align:center
Rs 1,500; Level 12 to 13A Rs 1,250; Level 9 to

133
00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:14.590 line:0% position:50% align:center
11 Rs 1,125; Level 6 to 8 Rs 1,000; and Level 5

