164
00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:07.560 line:0% position:50% align:center
The 2020 DoE clarification removed the city-travel voucher
condition for

165
00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:11.340 line:0% position:50% align:center
Pay Levels 9 to 11, but the self-certification must include
the travel

166
00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:14.120 line:0% position:50% align:center
